{"zh":[{"start":0.9,"end":3.48,"text":"怎样才能看见大气？"},{"start":3.5,"end":5.73,"text":"答案就在风中飘荡。"},{"start":5.75,"end":7.94,"text":"微小的颗粒，也就是气溶胶，"},{"start":7.96,"end":10.32,"text":"被空气带着绕地球流动。"},{"start":11.24,"end":14.05,"text":"这段可视化用的是 NASA 卫星的数据，"},{"start":14.07,"end":16.71,"text":"结合我们对物理学和气象学的认识，"},{"start":16.73,"end":19.8,"text":"追踪三种气溶胶：沙尘、烟和海盐。"},{"start":21.82,"end":23.68,"text":"海盐在这里用蓝色表示，"},{"start":23.7,"end":26.68,"text":"是风吹过海面时卷起来的。"},{"start":26.7,"end":29.33,"text":"当热带风暴和飓风形成时，"},{"start":29.35,"end":35.64,"text":"盐粒会聚成我们都认得的螺旋形状。"},{"start":35.66,"end":39.4,"text":"借助它们的运动，我们可以追踪飓风艾尔玛的形成，"},{"start":39.42,"end":42.23,"text":"还能看到撒哈拉的沙尘（棕黄色），"},{"start":42.25,"end":47.08,"text":"被雨水从风暴中心冲刷出去。"},{"start":47.1,"end":49.28,"text":"计算速度的进步让科学家"},{"start":49.3,"end":52.38,"text":"能把这些物理过程的更多细节"},{"start":52.4,"end":56.6,"text":"放进他们对气溶胶与风暴系统相互作用的模拟里。"},{"start":58.0,"end":61.12,"text":"计算机模拟的分辨率提高了，"},{"start":61.13,"end":62.59,"text":"在细节上一目了然，"},{"start":62.6,"end":66.76,"text":"比如逆时针旋转的飓风云带。"},{"start":69.26,"end":72.82,"text":"计算机模拟让我们看到不同的过程怎样配合在一起，"},{"start":72.85,"end":75.38,"text":"又怎样作为一个系统演变。"},{"start":75.4,"end":78.2,"text":"用数学模型来表示自然，"},{"start":78.22,"end":80.98,"text":"我们就能把系统拆成各个组成部分，"},{"start":81.0,"end":84.65,"text":"更好地理解每一部分背后的物理。"},{"start":84.66,"end":89.18,"text":"今天的研究提升明年的天气预报能力。"},{"start":93.0,"end":95.5,"text":"飓风奥菲莉亚非常不寻常。"},{"start":95.52,"end":98.22,"text":"它向东北移动，卷入撒哈拉的沙尘"},{"start":98.24,"end":100.73,"text":"和葡萄牙山火的烟，"},{"start":100.75,"end":103.73,"text":"把两者都带到了爱尔兰和英国。"},{"start":103.74,"end":108.28,"text":"这次气溶胶的相互作用和当季其他风暴很不一样。"},{"start":110.32,"end":112.54,"text":"随着计算速度继续提高，"},{"start":112.56,"end":116.98,"text":"科学家能把更多科学细节放进模拟里，"},{"start":117.0,"end":121.2,"text":"让我们更深入地了解我们的地球家园。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.9,"end":3.48,"text":"How can you see the atmosphere?","words":[["How","怎样"],["can","能"],["you","你"],["see","看见"],["the","这"],["atmosphere?","大气"]]},{"start":3.5,"end":5.73,"text":"The answer is blowing in the wind.","words":[["The","这"],["answer","答案"],["is","是"],["blowing","飘荡"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["wind.","风中"]]},{"start":5.75,"end":7.94,"text":"Tiny particles, known as aerosols,","words":[["Tiny","微小的"],["particles,","颗粒"],["known","被称为"],["as","作为"],["aerosols,","气溶胶"]]},{"start":7.96,"end":10.32,"text":"are carried by the air around the globe.","words":[["are","被"],["carried","携带"],["by","被"],["the","这"],["air","空气"],["around","绕着"],["the","这"],["globe.","地球"]]},{"start":11.24,"end":14.05,"text":"This visualization uses data from NASA satellites","words":[["This","这个"],["visualization","可视化"],["uses","使用"],["data","数据"],["from","来自"],["NASA","NASA"],["satellites","卫星"]]},{"start":14.07,"end":16.71,"text":"combined with our knowledge of physics and meteorology","words":[["combined","结合"],["with","与"],["our","我们的"],["knowledge","知识"],["of","关于"],["physics","物理学"],["and","和"],["meteorology","气象学"]]},{"start":16.73,"end":19.8,"text":"to track three aerosols: dust, smoke, and sea salt.","words":[["to","去"],["track","追踪"],["three","三种"],["aerosols:","气溶胶"],["dust,","沙尘"],["smoke,","烟"],["and","和"],["sea","海"],["salt.","盐"]]},{"start":21.82,"end":23.68,"text":"Sea salt, shown here in blue,","words":[["Sea","海"],["salt,","盐"],["shown","显示"],["here","在这里"],["in","用"],["blue,","蓝色"]]},{"start":23.7,"end":26.68,"text":"is picked up by winds passing over the ocean.","words":[["is","是"],["picked","卷起"],["up",""],["by","被"],["winds","风"],["passing","经过"],["over","越过"],["the","这"],["ocean.","海洋"]]},{"start":26.7,"end":29.33,"text":"As tropical storms and hurricanes form,","words":[["As","当"],["tropical","热带"],["storms","风暴"],["and","和"],["hurricanes","飓风"],["form,","形成"]]},{"start":29.35,"end":35.64,"text":"the salt particles are concentrated into the spiraling shape we all recognize.","words":[["the","这"],["salt","盐"],["particles","颗粒"],["are","被"],["concentrated","聚集"],["into","成"],["the","这"],["spiraling","螺旋的"],["shape","形状"],["we","我们"],["all","都"],["recognize.","认得"]]},{"start":35.66,"end":39.4,"text":"With their movements, we can follow the formation of Hurricane Irma","words":[["With","借助"],["their","它们的"],["movements,","运动"],["we","我们"],["can","能"],["follow","追踪"],["the","这"],["formation","形成"],["of","的"],["Hurricane","飓风"],["Irma","艾尔玛"]]},{"start":39.42,"end":42.23,"text":"and see the dust from the Sahara, shown in tan,","words":[["and","并"],["see","看到"],["the","这"],["dust","沙尘"],["from","来自"],["the","这"],["Sahara,","撒哈拉"],["shown","显示"],["in","用"],["tan,","棕黄色"]]},{"start":42.25,"end":47.08,"text":"get washed out of the storm center by the rain.","words":[["get","被"],["washed","冲"],["out","出"],["of",""],["the","这"],["storm","风暴"],["center","中心"],["by","被"],["the","这"],["rain.","雨"]]},{"start":47.1,"end":49.28,"text":"Advances in computing speed allow scientists","words":[["Advances","进步"],["in","在"],["computing","计算"],["speed","速度"],["allow","让"],["scientists","科学家"]]},{"start":49.3,"end":52.38,"text":"to include more details of these physical processes","words":[["to","去"],["include","纳入"],["more","更多"],["details","细节"],["of","的"],["these","这些"],["physical","物理"],["processes","过程"]]},{"start":52.4,"end":56.6,"text":"in their simulations of how the aerosols interact with the storm systems.","words":[["in","在"],["their","他们的"],["simulations","模拟"],["of","关于"],["how","如何"],["the","这"],["aerosols","气溶胶"],["interact","相互作用"],["with","与"],["the","这"],["storm","风暴"],["systems.","系统"]]},{"start":58.0,"end":61.12,"text":"The increased resolution of the computer simulation","words":[["The","这"],["increased","提高的"],["resolution","分辨率"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["computer","计算机"],["simulation","模拟"]]},{"start":61.13,"end":62.59,"text":"is apparent in fine details","words":[["is","是"],["apparent","明显"],["in","在"],["fine","精细"],["details","细节"]]},{"start":62.6,"end":66.76,"text":"like the hurricane bands spiraling counter-clockwise.","words":[["like","比如"],["the","这"],["hurricane","飓风"],["bands","带"],["spiraling","旋转"],["counter-clockwise.","逆时针"]]},{"start":69.26,"end":72.82,"text":"Computer simulations let us see how different processes fit together","words":[["Computer","计算机"],["simulations","模拟"],["let","让"],["us","我们"],["see","看到"],["how","如何"],["different","不同的"],["processes","过程"],["fit","配合"],["together","在一起"]]},{"start":72.85,"end":75.38,"text":"and evolve as a system.","words":[["and","并"],["evolve","演变"],["as","作为"],["a","一个"],["system.","系统"]]},{"start":75.4,"end":78.2,"text":"By using mathematical models to represent nature","words":[["By","通过"],["using","使用"],["mathematical","数学的"],["models","模型"],["to","来"],["represent","表示"],["nature","自然"]]},{"start":78.22,"end":80.98,"text":"we can separate the system into component parts","words":[["we","我们"],["can","能"],["separate","拆分"],["the","这"],["system","系统"],["into","成"],["component","组成"],["parts","部分"]]},{"start":81.0,"end":84.65,"text":"and better understand the underlying physics of each.","words":[["and","并"],["better","更好"],["understand","理解"],["the","这"],["underlying","背后的"],["physics","物理"],["of","的"],["each.","每个"]]},{"start":84.66,"end":89.18,"text":"Today's research improves next year's weather forecasting ability.","words":[["Today's","今天的"],["research","研究"],["improves","提升"],["next","下一"],["year's","年的"],["weather","天气"],["forecasting","预报"],["ability.","能力"]]},{"start":93.0,"end":95.5,"text":"Hurricane Ophelia was very unusual.","words":[["Hurricane","飓风"],["Ophelia","奥菲莉亚"],["was","曾"],["very","非常"],["unusual.","不寻常"]]},{"start":95.52,"end":98.22,"text":"It headed northeast, pulling in Saharan dust","words":[["It","它"],["headed","前往"],["northeast,","东北"],["pulling","卷入"],["in","进"],["Saharan","撒哈拉的"],["dust","沙尘"]]},{"start":98.24,"end":100.73,"text":"and smoke from wildfires in Portugal,","words":[["and","和"],["smoke","烟"],["from","来自"],["wildfires","山火"],["in","在"],["Portugal,","葡萄牙"]]},{"start":100.75,"end":103.73,"text":"carrying both to Ireland and the UK.","words":[["carrying","携带"],["both","两者"],["to","到"],["Ireland","爱尔兰"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["UK.","英国"]]},{"start":103.74,"end":108.28,"text":"This aerosol interaction was very different from other storms of the season.","words":[["This","这个"],["aerosol","气溶胶"],["interaction","相互作用"],["was","曾"],["very","很"],["different","不同"],["from","于"],["other","其他"],["storms","风暴"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["season.","季节"]]},{"start":110.32,"end":112.54,"text":"As computing speed continues to increase,","words":[["As","随着"],["computing","计算"],["speed","速度"],["continues","继续"],["to","去"],["increase,","提高"]]},{"start":112.56,"end":116.98,"text":"scientists will be able to bring more scientific details into the simulations,","words":[["scientists","科学家"],["will","将"],["be","是"],["able","能够"],["to","去"],["bring","带"],["more","更多"],["scientific","科学"],["details","细节"],["into","进"],["the","这"],["simulations,","模拟"]]},{"start":117.0,"end":121.2,"text":"giving us a deeper understanding of our home planet.","words":[["giving","给"],["us","我们"],["a","一个"],["deeper","更深的"],["understanding","理解"],["of","的"],["our","我们的"],["home","家园"],["planet.","行星"]]}]}